{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2D pixel-style RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If one day, you were reincarnated into a Galgame and became the heroine, what would you do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullied by hooligans, perverted old men, and goblins? No, I'm going to hit back hard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too weak? Don't worry, use the power granted by the goddess and embark on an adventure in this peril-ridden alternate world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Magic shooting: The protagonist will use various magic bullets, skills, and melee attacks to attack enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Cruel Enemies: With a vast number of monsters in the maze, can you survive the onslaught?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Day and night alternation/Gathering and Alchemy: A realistic day and night alternation system, gathering and alchemy system, and so on...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789950?t=1754438769","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789950/5076d780c807bad44cb58d7992e1731d723eea3c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754438769","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789950/0e319115e911c741b90f24ed527c2e58d758eb5a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754438769","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789950/0e319115e911c741b90f24ed527c2e58d758eb5a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754438769","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2D pixel-style RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If one day, you were reincarnated into a Galgame and became the heroine, what would you do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullied by hooligans, perverted old men, and goblins? No, I'm going to hit back hard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too weak? Don't worry, use the power granted by the goddess and embark on an adventure in this peril-ridden alternate world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Magic shooting: The protagonist will use various magic bullets, skills, and melee attacks to attack enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Cruel Enemies: With a vast number of monsters in the maze, can you survive the onslaught?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Day and night alternation/Gathering and Alchemy: A realistic day and night alternation system, gathering and alchemy system, and so on...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Crazy Slime"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789950/fa306b91c8db66ed7bcb17c9c81486efaf96c1b8/header.jpg?t=1754438769","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3789950/1455448480/1ffcf674c46eade3c220c7097662f9e0ce0127a0/1750376946/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749685994","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3789950/1455448480/1ffcf674c46eade3c220c7097662f9e0ce0127a0/1750376946/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749685994","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3789950/1455448480/1ffcf674c46eade3c220c7097662f9e0ce0127a0/1750376946/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749685994","id":257152856,"name":"show","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152856/94493852c17b33c4bf505831eb2b9f8e043